OL,12,G0350 Witness History
OL,13,     FIn 1984, when doctors in the USA
OL,14,     Fwere unable to find a human donor,
OL,15,     Fthey transplanted a baboon's heart
OL,16,     Finto a baby girl to try and save
OL,17,     Fher life.
